    "Morgan similarities are low (approximately 0.20-0.24), limiting structural transferability.",
    "Evidence directions are mixed across similar molecules, with both clear brain penetration and poor CNS exposure outcomes.",
    "Species and endpoint types vary (rat/mouse/human brain distribution vs monkey/dog CSF ratios), complicating direct comparison."
  ],
